CRITERION 5 - Load failure degrades honestly.  PASS (with a gap, see FINDING A)
=====================================================================
Exercised with the corrupt-file lever in the out-of-tree probe: overwrote
<csvdir>/transfer_decisions.json with "{ this is not json" and re-posted.

  PROBE crit5 corrupt-file: status=200 msg="Could not resolve transfer: the stored
      decision for pair 197a8e9d43a8 could not be read (invalid transfer_decisions
