The message says the stored state could not be read and guesses no verdict: it
contains neither "already confirmed" nor "already rejected" nor "not a known pair".
Behaviour is correct and demonstrated. Still 200, so criterion 4 holds here too.

(The chmod-000 lever did not trip the error path in this environment - the read
succeeded - so the corrupt-JSON lever is the one that carries this criterion.)

